The '''Geonosian War Room''',<ref name="SWCT">{{SWCT|set=The Growing Menace|cardname=The Separatist Council in the Geonosian War Room}}</ref> also known as the '''Geonosian Command Center'''<ref name="Complete Vehicles 2018">[[Star Wars: Complete Vehicles (2018)|''Star Wars: Complete Vehicles'' (2018)]]</ref> or the '''Stalgasin war room''',<ref name="Catalyst">''[[Catalyst: A Rogue One Novel]]''</ref> was a command center on [[Geonosis]] from which [[Count]] [[Dooku]], [[Archduke]] [[Poggle the Lesser]], and [[Viceroy]] [[Nute Gunray]] monitored the ongoing [[First Battle of Geonosis]]<ref name="Complete Vehicles 2018" /> in [[22 BBY]].<ref name="GA">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> It was equipped with a large circular [[holotable]], and there was a [[hangar]] nearby.<ref name="Complete Vehicles 2018" /> At some point prior to his capture during the [[Second Battle of Geonosis]], the Poggle the Lesser managed to delete all [[Death Star plans|data]] of a [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|mobile battle station]] from the [[computer]]s in the war room. Despite this, the [[Galactic Republic|Republic]] was still able to learn about the existence of the [[battle station]].<ref name="Catalyst" />

